{"title":"2019 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Formal)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Formal)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Comprehensive🧠)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Comprehensive🧠)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_(English-Chinese_Bilingual)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/9/289baf6aac9fddce693a26364041d4d5b550c685.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x) = \\lfloor|x|\\rfloor - |\\lfloor x \\rfloor|\\]\" width=\"152\" height=\"19\" />for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/1/af185d2067f3958364022a1d2cc3b49403514b39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor r \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" /> denotes the greatest integer less than or equal to the real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. What is the range of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/f/d5fb5c6ba1529faa7d7b2434df76ed9f3112bd3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } \\{-1, 0\\} \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } \\text{The set of nonpositive integers} \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } \\{-1, 0, 1\\} \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } \\{0\\} \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } \\text{The set of nonnegative integers}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"922\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are four cases we need to consider here.\n</p><p><b>Case 1</b>: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is a positive integer. Without loss of generality, assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/2/512d457997cfdf02335cf27ee27cccd66372ebea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) = 1 - 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"131\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><b>Case 2</b>: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is a positive fraction. Without loss of generality, assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/4/a14649b556d4c316856b101be1b84a92084b195b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/0/2602e51b2350647f2760a13efc7c0820c18e7c64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right) = 0 - 0 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"150\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p><p><b>Case 3</b>: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is a negative integer. Without loss of generality, assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/c/86c2e8c17cff668023b2f29f2e95e4a0fafa6271.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/4/93410fd0831d0aaa3621ce4dba7dd395842c05dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(-1) = 1 - 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"145\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><b>Case 4</b>: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is a negative fraction. Without loss of generality, assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/2/9a2ba57c2738a318a9a95c1a2a53691ee1581875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"60\" height=\"37\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/6/8a61ee8bacb2ef8bec62382a9ef5c45a6107e42a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right) = 0 - 1 = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"178\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p><p>Thus the range of the function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/9/ff9faa304ddf5f32c93b1a750046a3f0e238472e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } \\{-1, 0\\}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"106\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p><p>~IronicNinja\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It is easily verified that when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is an integer, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is zero. We therefore need only to consider the case when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is not an integer.\n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is positive, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/c/a1c3e8b7088ecd8405ccc717e56cc5ce9a444765.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x\\rfloor \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"62\" height=\"20\" />, so \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/4/ae40b05e3befd3c7e209d489bc5a47d49cd83f23.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{split}f(x)&amp;=\\lfloor|x|\\rfloor-|\\lfloor x\\rfloor| \\\\ &amp;=\\lfloor x\\rfloor-\\lfloor x\\rfloor \\\\ &amp;=0\\end{split}\\]\" width=\"152\" height=\"63\" />\n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is negative, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/f/c9f5d276f9ed06dd1a7aca19cb69243503cb2d77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-a-b$\" width=\"88\" height=\"12\" /> be composed of integer part <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and fractional part <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> (both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/0/e100ee688f8f0162a35c7f18712c28592f7c5916.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"27\" height=\"15\" />):\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/0/9c0097ae9154a8bbf4dc0af789e1dc87a94a906b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{split}f(x)&amp;=\\lfloor|-a-b|\\rfloor-|\\lfloor -a-b\\rfloor| \\\\ &amp;=\\lfloor a+b\\rfloor-|-a-1| \\\\ &amp;=a-(a+1)=-1\\end{split}\\]\" width=\"247\" height=\"68\" />\n</p><p>Thus, the range of x is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/9/ff9faa304ddf5f32c93b1a750046a3f0e238472e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } \\{-1, 0\\}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"106\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p><p><i>Note</i>: One could solve the case of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> as a negative non-integer in this way:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/8/368c7126c1387fa681036ae041a8e246023f78e6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{split}f(x)&amp;=\\lfloor|x|\\rfloor-|\\lfloor x\\rfloor| \\\\ &amp;=\\lfloor -x\\rfloor-|-\\lfloor -x\\rfloor-1| \\\\ &amp;=\\lfloor -x\\rfloor-(\\lfloor -x\\rfloor+1) = -1\\end{split}\\]\" width=\"254\" height=\"69\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Formal.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Formal)\">Solution 3 (Formal)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Formal)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let {<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />} denote the fractional part of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />; for example, {<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/a/d3aff9327b7e6636a6344be9e8f24451f747d5b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" />}<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/4/27430b70f70804e008b5e37972abe0f72fa69596.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 0.7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, and {<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/8/90849951c54a9002fdd66a891c967587a3d2f579.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1.3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" />}<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/1/43100e944c6a4590f6d4ae4c1db2a109e0378b7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 0.3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />. \nThen for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/d/44df9cb6ce6f056c64c197a004b64fc4dd3a5aa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/9/649b605d4a8ab4e1c749587e1f17eb81b00d4cbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\lfloor x \\rfloor +$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"74\" height=\"19\" /> {<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />} and for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/a/36a68e8aa6ec6f48231ad80a4851f84bacf641b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/0199913c574e4a84f799b058ffdae3ce8ace021a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\lfloor x \\rfloor + 1 -$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"108\" height=\"20\" />{<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />}.\n</p><p>Now we can rewrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/9/2897ab3dada68cd53f5ec0f3804fd8d68614b0f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor |x| \\rfloor - |\\lfloor x \\rfloor|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"97\" height=\"20\" />, breaking the expression up based on whether <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/d/44df9cb6ce6f056c64c197a004b64fc4dd3a5aa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/a/36a68e8aa6ec6f48231ad80a4851f84bacf641b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/d/44df9cb6ce6f056c64c197a004b64fc4dd3a5aa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, the above expression is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/b/56b9ee56315555be96ea757d74b3a1ed8c43f382.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor |\\lfloor x \\rfloor +$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"20\" />{<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />}<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/7/0b737cc4626d05c8d55e334835f12c6d53452459.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$| \\rfloor - | \\lfloor \\lfloor x \\rfloor +$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"91\" height=\"20\" /> {<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />}<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/0/340dc0a16d19c1c39756a736b1f5066a3c83a75c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rfloor | \\implies \\lfloor \\lfloor x \\rfloor +$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"113\" height=\"20\" />{<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />}<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/4/684035466440690385aa44facc4133a04bf5ad4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rfloor - | \\lfloor x \\rfloor |$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/b/bcbfe3bf9ffd94cf4fcc20fe7e996088fd166c7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies \\lfloor x \\rfloor - \\lfloor x \\rfloor = \\mathbf{0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/a/36a68e8aa6ec6f48231ad80a4851f84bacf641b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, the expression is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/c/57cacb74298f830f7e64a4ee39677482a8a3214c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor |\\lfloor x \\rfloor + 1 -$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"87\" height=\"20\" />{<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />}<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/4/91425697306b2d5aebe945ad15d6363537aa6534.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$| \\rfloor - | \\lfloor \\lfloor x \\rfloor + 1 -$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"122\" height=\"20\" /> {<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />}<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/e/56eaae280c92a93d5196788dce6f22901d3e75f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rfloor |$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/b/6fb0cf4aca4e59ee70415903ab3011d1314822bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies \\lfloor - \\lfloor x \\rfloor - 1 +$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\" />{<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />}<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/7/717e3a1bf34ec36befc3852750d17bcf44282d18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rfloor - | \\lfloor x \\rfloor | \\implies - \\lfloor x \\rfloor  - 1 - (- \\lfloor x \\rfloor) = \\mathbf{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"316\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore the only two possible values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" />, and thus the range of the function, is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/9/ff9faa304ddf5f32c93b1a750046a3f0e238472e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } \\{-1, 0\\}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"106\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p><p>~KingRavi\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have 2 cases: either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is positive or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is negative.\n</p><p><br />\n<b>Case 1 - x is positive:</b>\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/7/79792d33824f3563e9c580a56264b948c439c54f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = n + f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is a positive integer and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is a positive real number between 0 and 1. We have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/d/c2dd65d1f6d6ed9e30862ccbe9cab9393cc8dc4c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\lfloor |x| \\rfloor = \\lfloor |n+f| \\rfloor = \\lfloor n+f \\rfloor = n\\]\" width=\"247\" height=\"18\" /> and\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/5/db50cb163777e29d34799e6451ec2a02b942e99e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[|\\lfloor x \\rfloor| = |\\lfloor n+f \\rfloor| = |n| = n.\\]\" width=\"213\" height=\"18\" /> \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/3/86352e3162eac861a6d6c78909e0306eea57b40a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-n=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" />, so the possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is positive is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p><br />\n<b>Case 2 - x is negative: </b>\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/c/67ce61b75199bf8bff89c446a32b92e065efe88e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -n - f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is a positive integer and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is a positive real number between 0 and 1. We have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/f/c7f3f6dc6aeca287c3cba673013bb5eb8a67624b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\lfloor |x| \\rfloor = \\lfloor |-n-f| \\rfloor = \\lfloor n+f \\rfloor = n\\]\" width=\"269\" height=\"18\" /> and\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/4/7b43d3e271bb3494e49a577dd1d5517d22b4ca36.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[|\\lfloor x \\rfloor| = |\\lfloor -n-f \\rfloor| =|-n|\\:or\\: |-n-1|= n \\:or\\: n+1.\\]\" width=\"417\" height=\"18\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/3/86352e3162eac861a6d6c78909e0306eea57b40a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-n=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/4/dc4dc4e110eba876834034cd40120387c3f41398.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-(n+1) = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"139\" height=\"20\" />, so the possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is negative are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/3/09352e06cfa1651aa82e838b91724b60b068d41d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> \n</p><p><br />\nHence, the possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/9/ff9faa304ddf5f32c93b1a750046a3f0e238472e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } \\{-1, 0\\}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"106\" height=\"29\" />. ~azc1027\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/LffjyNNqf14\">https://youtu.be/LffjyNNqf14</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/PgqjsTkNYdc\">https://youtu.be/PgqjsTkNYdc</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Comprehensive.F0.9F.A7.A0.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Comprehensive🧠)\">Video Solution (Comprehensive🧠)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Comprehensive🧠)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/evq2BTEogvs\">https://youtu.be/evq2BTEogvs</a>\n</p><p>~Ani_lytical\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_.28English-Chinese_Bilingual.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_(English-Chinese_Bilingual)\">Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/IusmUTxAMhc\">https://youtu.be/IusmUTxAMhc</a>\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B\" title=\"2019 AMC 10B\">2019 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2019 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2019 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2019 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2019 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2019 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2019 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2019 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Probl